    "A bot changed the group memory while you were editing. Nothing was saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bot changed the group memory while you were editing. Nothing was saved."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un bot a modifié la mémoire du groupe pendant votre édition. Rien n'a été enregistré."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um bot alterou a memória do grupo enquanto você editava. Nada foi salvo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bot is working on this computer. Reset anyway? Its current task is cut short and the computer is rebuilt from the last snapshot. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bot is working on this computer. Reset anyway? Its current task is cut short and the computer is rebuilt from the last snapshot. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un bot travaille sur cet ordinateur. Réinitialiser quand même ? Sa tâche en cours est coupée et l'ordinateur est reconstruit à partir du dernier instantané. C'est irréversible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bot takes notes in your meetings. Not yet proven in a real meeting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un bot prend des notes pendant tes réunions. Pas encore éprouvé en vraie réunion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bot without its own list mounts every enabled server: the change starts from that set.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bot without its own list mounts every enabled server: the change starts from that set."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un bot sans liste à lui monte tous les serveurs activés : la modification part de cet ensemble."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bot’s memory has no folders: the folder starts each note’s name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La mémoire d’un bot n’a pas de dossiers : le dossier commence le nom de chaque note."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A built-in group of team memory: delete its notes one by one": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un groupe intégré de la mémoire d’équipe : supprimez ses notes une à une"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A calendar. Drop a bot on a time and it runs by itself; the result lands in its chat. Next takes you back to the chat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un calendrier. Déposez un bot sur une heure et il s'exécute tout seul ; le résultat arrive dans sa conversation. Suivant vous ramène à la conversation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A call runs on the realtime voice, never text to speech. Add or fix the xAI key in Settings > Voice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un appel passe par la voix en temps réel, jamais par la synthèse vocale. Ajoutez ou corrigez la clé xAI dans Réglages > Voix."
          }
        }
      }
    },
