    "A password-protected backup of this installation: bots, conversations, instructions, local files, and non-secret settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A password-protected backup of this installation: bots, conversations, instructions, local files, and non-secret settings."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une sauvegarde protégée par mot de passe de cette installation : bots, conversations, instructions, fichiers locaux et réglages non secrets."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um backup protegido por senha desta instalação: bots, conversas, instruções, arquivos locais e ajustes não secretos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A password-protected backup of this installation: bots, conversations, instructions, local files, and non-secret settings. Drafts and preferences from this browser are included.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une sauvegarde protégée par mot de passe : bots, conversations, instructions, fichiers locaux et réglages non secrets, avec les brouillons et préférences de ce navigateur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A person of your organization": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A person of your organization"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une personne de votre organisation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A private address, refused": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A private address, refused"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adresse privée, refusée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A proactive action follows this bot's approval level and rules, exactly like a normal action.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A proactive action follows this bot's approval level and rules, exactly like a normal action."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une action proactive suit le niveau d'approbation et les règles de ce bot, exactement comme une action normale."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma ação proativa segue o nível de aprovação e as regras deste bot, exatamente como uma ação normal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A provider is an account, a key or a server. Each row says who pays, where its key lives and what it brings. Bots, Auto and voice only choose among them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bots, Auto and voice only use the providers listed here."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les bots, Auto et la voix n'utilisent que les fournisseurs listés ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A read tool of a connection, fixed arguments": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A read tool of a connection, fixed arguments"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un outil de lecture d'une connexion, arguments fixes"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A read tool of a connection, fixed arguments"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A remote server (an https address) or a command that runs in your server environment, never on the Sagax server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A remote server (an https address) or a command that runs in your server environment, never on the Sagax server."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un serveur distant (adresse https) ou une commande qui s'exécute dans votre environnement serveur, jamais sur le serveur Sagax."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um servidor remoto (um endereço https) ou um comando que roda no seu ambiente de servidor, nunca no servidor do Sagax."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A removed bot": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un Bot retiré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A role fills in the role sentence, a starting soul and the suggestions of the next steps. Everything stays editable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A role fills in the role sentence, a starting soul and the suggestions of the next steps. Everything stays editable."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un rôle remplit la phrase de rôle, une soul de départ et les suggestions des étapes suivantes. Tout reste modifiable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A room shows only to people who can see every bot in it, and this bot works only with teammates exactly the same people can see.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A room shows only to people who can see every bot in it, and this bot works only with teammates exactly the same people can see."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un salon n'apparaît qu'aux personnes qui voient chacun de ses bots, et ce bot ne travaille qu'avec des coéquipiers que voient exactement les mêmes personnes."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma sala só aparece para quem vê todos os bots dela, e este bot só trabalha com colegas que exatamente as mesmas pessoas veem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A routine’s webhook is managed in that routine, its key included. A webhook of its own is created on the paired computer. Webhook run receipts still appear in Run logs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A routine’s webhook is managed in that routine, its key included. A webhook of its own is created on the paired computer. Webhook run receipts still appear in Run logs."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le webhook d’une routine se gère dans cette routine, sa clé comprise. Un webhook autonome se crée sur l’ordinateur jumelé. Les reçus d’exécution des webhooks restent dans les journaux d’exécution."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O webhook de uma rotina é gerenciado nessa rotina, incluindo a chave. Um webhook próprio é criado no computador pareado. Os recibos de execução de webhooks continuam nos registros de execução."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A routine’s webhook is managed in that routine; a webhook of its own, in Automations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A routine’s webhook is managed in that routine; a webhook of its own, in Automations."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le webhook d’une routine se gère dans cette routine ; un webhook autonome, dans Automatisations."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O webhook de uma rotina é gerenciado nessa rotina; um webhook próprio, em Automações."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule that allows, or a looser permission mode for a bot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une règle qui permet, ou un mode de permission plus large pour un robot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A safety hold": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A safety hold"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
