          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An admin-tier access needs an end, 30 days at most.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An admin-tier access needs an end, 30 days at most."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un accès de niveau admin doit avoir une fin, 30 jours au plus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An administrator of the organization creates them in the Perspicax console.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un administrateur de l'organisation les crée dans la console Perspicax."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An administrator turned off Claude connectors on this server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An administrator turned off Claude connectors on this server."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un administrateur a désactivé les connecteurs Claude sur ce serveur."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um administrador desligou os conectores do Claude neste servidor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An agent is working. Update will be available when every agent is done. Your files and logins stay, installed apps and packages are removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An agent is working. Update will be available when every agent is done. Your files and logins stay, installed apps and packages are removed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un agent travaille. La mise à jour sera possible quand chaque agent aura fini. Vos fichiers et vos connexions restent, les apps et paquets installés sont retirés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An approval is waiting for you in this bot's conversation. Answer it to change the model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une approbation t'attend dans la conversation de ce bot. Réponds-y pour changer le modèle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An attachment is waiting to resume. Open its conversation to retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An attachment is waiting to resume. Open its conversation to retry."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une pièce jointe attend la reprise. Ouvrez sa conversation pour réessayer."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um anexo está aguardando a retomada. Abra a conversa para tentar de novo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An email or a text goes without a card when every recipient is on this list. A bot on the list is reached without the confirmation step. Payments, invitations, shares, posts and replies always ask for an approval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un courriel ou un texto part sans carte quand chaque destinataire est sur la liste. Un bot de la liste est joint sans l'étape de confirmation. Les paiements, invitations, partages, publications et réponses demandent toujours une approbation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An email or a text goes without a card when every recipient is on this list. Bots on the list count once \"Ask me before contacting other bots\" is on. Payments, invitations, shares, posts and replies always ask for an approval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un courriel ou un texto part sans carte quand chaque destinataire est sur la liste. Les bots de la liste comptent quand « Me demander avant de contacter d'autres bots » est activé. Les paiements, invitations, partages, publications et réponses demandent toujours une approbation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An email, a message or a post that reaches someone else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un courriel, un message ou une publication qui rejoint quelqu'un d'autre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An encrypted copy of your bots, conversations and files, to restore here or on another computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An encrypted copy of your bots, conversations and files, to restore here or on another computer."
