    "Applies to": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies to"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S'applique à"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies to direct bot threads, including Primary Bot and delegated work. Channels are not included. Only this thread switches; bot defaults stay unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S'applique aux conversations directes, y compris le bot principal et le travail délégué, pas aux canaux. Seule la conversation change de modèle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies to every bot turn in groups. Direct threads use the inactivity watchdog instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies to every bot turn in groups. Direct threads use the inactivity watchdog instead."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S'applique à chaque tour de bot dans les groupes. Les fils directs utilisent plutôt la surveillance d'inactivité."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vale para cada turno de bot em grupos. Conversas diretas usam o vigia de inatividade."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies to every thread of this bot at once: routines, delegated work and work another bot or an AI client sends here. A thread keeps its own level only when you chose one in it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies to every thread of this bot at once: routines, delegated work and work another bot or an AI client sends here. A thread keeps its own level only when you chose one in it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S'applique à toutes les conversations de ce bot d'un coup : routines, travail délégué et travail qu'un autre bot ou un client IA envoie ici. Une conversation garde son propre niveau seulement si vous l'y avez choisi."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vale para todas as conversas deste bot de uma vez: rotinas, trabalho delegado e trabalho que outro bot ou um cliente de IA envia para cá. Uma conversa mantém o próprio nível só quando você escolheu um nela."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies to every thread of this bot at once: routines, delegated work and work another bot or an AI client sends here. A thread keeps its own level only when you chose one in it; Refresh permissions brings it back to this level.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S'applique à toutes les conversations de ce bot d'un coup : routines, travail délégué et travail qu'un autre bot ou un client IA envoie ici. Une conversation garde son propre niveau seulement si tu l'y as choisi ; Actualiser les permissions la ramène à ce niveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
