    "Checked bots belong to this team. Uncheck a bot to move it to General. Moving changes who they can work with and which shared instructions they read. Their chats stay with them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checked bots belong to this team. Uncheck a bot to move it to General. Moving changes who they can work with and which shared instructions they read. Their chats stay with them."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les bots cochés font partie de cette équipe. Décochez un bot pour le déplacer vers Général. Le déplacement change avec qui ils peuvent travailler et les instructions partagées qu'ils lisent. Leurs discussions restent avec eux."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os bots marcados pertencem a esta equipe. Desmarque um bot para movê-lo para Geral. Mover muda com quem eles podem trabalhar e quais instruções compartilhadas leem. As conversas continuam com eles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked bots belong to this team. Uncheck a bot to move it to Unassigned. Moving changes who they can work with and which shared instructions they read. Their chats stay with them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checked bots belong to this team. Uncheck a bot to move it to Unassigned. Moving changes who they can work with and which shared instructions they read. Their chats stay with them."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les bots cochés font partie de cette équipe. Décochez un bot pour le déplacer vers Non assigné. Le déplacement change avec qui ils peuvent travailler et les instructions partagées qu'ils lisent. Leurs discussions restent avec eux."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os bots marcados pertencem a esta equipe. Desmarque um bot para movê-lo para Não atribuído. Mover muda com quem eles podem trabalhar e quais instruções compartilhadas leem. As conversas continuam com eles."
          }
        }
