    },
    "Duration %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Duration %@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Durée %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Duration is how long the routine fills on the calendar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Duration is how long the routine fills on the calendar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La durée est l’espace que la routine occupe dans le calendrier."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A duração é o espaço que a rotina ocupa no calendário."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "During"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pendant"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Durante"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each bot is changed in turn, as if you had edited it alone: the change shows in its Changes, and a bot that refuses says why.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque Bot est changé à tour de rôle, comme si vous le modifiiez seul : le changement paraît dans son historique, et un Bot qui refuse dit pourquoi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each bot is changed on its own, as in its own settings: a bot that refuses keeps its values and says why.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each bot is changed on its own, as in its own settings: a bot that refuses keeps its values and says why."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque bot est modifié séparément, comme dans ses propres réglages : un bot qui refuse garde ses valeurs et dit pourquoi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each bot’s own folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each bot’s own folder"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dossier propre à chaque bot"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A pasta de cada bot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each bot’s own folder, or an absolute path": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each bot’s own folder, or an absolute path"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dossier propre à chaque bot, ou un chemin absolu"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A pasta de cada bot, ou um caminho absoluto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each computer is paired separately. Only the selected computer is active at a time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque ordinateur est jumelé séparément. Un seul ordinateur est actif à la fois."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada computador é pareado separadamente. Só o computador selecionado fica ativo por vez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each file must be under %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque fichier doit faire moins de %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each occurrence creates a fresh task. If the previous run is still active, the next occurrence is skipped instead of queued.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque occurrence crée une nouvelle tâche. Si l'exécution précédente est encore en cours, l'occurrence suivante est sautée au lieu d'être mise en file."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada ocorrência cria uma tarefa nova. Se a execução anterior ainda estiver ativa, a próxima ocorrência é pulada em vez de entrar na fila."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each occurrence creates a fresh task. No cron syntax is used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque occurrence crée une nouvelle tâche. Aucune syntaxe cron n'est utilisée."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada ocorrência cria uma tarefa nova. Nenhuma sintaxe de cron é usada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each person": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each person"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque personne"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each person pays for their own messages. When this bot's engine isn't available to them, it answers with their default model (their first starred model).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each person pays for their own messages. When this bot's engine isn't available to them, it answers with their default model (their first starred model)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque personne paie ses propres messages. Quand le moteur de ce robot ne lui est pas offert, il répond avec son modèle par défaut (son premier modèle étoilé)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each rule allows one exact command for this bot, provider and working folder, including other threads using that folder. Rules stay saved until removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each rule allows one exact command for this bot, provider and working folder, including other threads using that folder. Rules stay saved until removed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque règle autorise une commande exacte pour ce bot, ce fournisseur et ce dossier de travail, y compris les autres fils qui utilisent ce dossier. Les règles restent enregistrées jusqu'à ce qu'on les retire."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada regra permite um comando exato para este bot, provedor e pasta de trabalho, incluindo outras conversas que usam essa pasta. As regras ficam salvas até serem removidas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each rule always allows one exact command in one folder for one bot. Swipe left to remove it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each rule always allows one exact command in one folder for one bot. Swipe left to remove it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque règle autorise toujours une commande exacte dans un dossier pour un bot. Balayez vers la gauche pour la retirer."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada regra sempre permite um comando exato em uma pasta para um bot. Deslize para a esquerda para removê-la."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each run starts with fresh context. Dated results collect here; full execution details stay in Run logs. A dedicated results thread is reused for every run and can be moved into a folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each run starts with fresh context. Dated results collect here; full execution details stay in Run logs. A dedicated results thread is reused for every run and can be moved into a folder."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque exécution part d’un contexte neuf. Les résultats datés s’accumulent ici; le détail complet reste dans le journal des exécutions. Un fil de résultats dédié est réutilisé à chaque exécution et peut être déplacé dans un dossier."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada execução começa com contexto novo. Os resultados datados se acumulam aqui; os detalhes completos ficam nos registros de execução. Uma conversa dedicada aos resultados é reutilizada em cada execução e pode ser movida para uma pasta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each run starts with fresh context. Dated results collect in the bot's main thread; full execution details stay in Run logs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each run starts with fresh context. Dated results collect in the bot's main thread; full execution details stay in Run logs."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque exécution repart d'un contexte vierge. Les résultats datés s'accumulent dans le fil principal du bot ; les détails complets d'exécution restent dans les journaux d'exécution."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada execução começa com contexto novo. Os resultados datados ficam na conversa principal do bot; os detalhes completos da execução ficam nos registros de execução."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each run starts with the previous run's report, so the bot knows what it found last time. Good for checks like QA or monitoring.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each run starts with the previous run's report, so the bot knows what it found last time. Good for checks like QA or monitoring."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque exécution commence par le compte rendu de la précédente, pour que le bot sache ce qu'il a trouvé la dernière fois. Utile pour des vérifications comme l'assurance qualité ou la surveillance."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada execução começa com o relatório da anterior, para que o bot saiba o que encontrou da última vez. Bom para verificações como QA ou monitoramento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each turn runs on the subscription of the person who speaks first, then on their key in Perspicax, then on the organization's key if an admin set one. A bot's routines always use its owner's credentials.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each turn runs on the subscription of the person who speaks first, then on their key in Perspicax, then on the organization's key if an admin set one. A bot's routines always use its owner's credentials."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque tour utilise d'abord l'abonnement de la personne qui parle, puis sa clé dans Perspicax, puis la clé de l'organisation si un admin en a configuré une. Les routines d'un bot utilisent toujours les identifiants de son propriétaire."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada turno usa primeiro a assinatura de quem fala, depois a chave dessa pessoa no Perspicax, depois a chave da organização se um admin a configurou. As rotinas de um bot sempre usam as credenciais do dono."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Earlier topics": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
