    "How do you want to set up your new bot? You can switch at any time without losing anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How do you want to set up your new bot? You can switch at any time without losing anything."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment voulez-vous configurer votre nouveau bot? Vous pouvez changer en tout temps sans rien perdre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How each bot reaches you outside the app, and when.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How each bot reaches you outside the app, and when."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment chaque bot vous joint hors de l'app, et quand."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Como cada bot fala com você fora do app, e quando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How hard every new bot thinks from its first message. A bot can change its own level; model providers without this level keep their default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How hard every new bot thinks from its first message. A bot can change its own level; model providers without this level keep their default."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'intensité de réflexion de chaque nouveau bot dès son premier message. Un bot peut changer son propre niveau; les fournisseurs sans ce niveau gardent leur réglage par défaut."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quanto cada novo bot pensa desde a primeira mensagem. Um bot pode mudar o próprio nível; provedores sem esse nível mantêm o padrão."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How hard it thinks in groups and new threads": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa réflexion dans les groupes et les nouvelles conversations"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How hard new bots think from their first message.": {
