    "How it talks": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How it talks"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment il parle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it talks and what it does. Answer what you like, then let it write its soul from your answers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How it talks and what it does. Answer what you like, then let it write its soul from your answers."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment il parle et ce qu'il fait. Répondez à ce que vous voulez, puis laissez-le écrire son soul à partir de vos réponses."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it works, every conversation": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How it works, every conversation"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa façon de travailler, à chaque conversation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long a bot may keep working in this conversation before the turn stops. Default uses the group turn limit in Settings. A new choice applies to the next turn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How long a bot may keep working in this conversation before the turn stops. Default uses the group turn limit in Settings. A new choice applies to the next turn."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Durée pendant laquelle un bot peut continuer à travailler dans cette conversation avant que le tour s'arrête. Par défaut utilise la limite de tour de groupe dans les Réglages. Un nouveau choix s'applique au prochain tour."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quanto tempo um bot pode trabalhar nesta conversa antes de o turno parar. Padrão usa o limite de turno dos grupos nos Ajustes. Uma nova escolha vale para o próximo turno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long a pause ends what you say. An unfinished sentence always gets more time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le temps de pause qui termine ce que vous dites. Une phrase inachevée a toujours plus de temps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many turns Sagax starts on its own while the condition is not met, before it waits for you. A message from you starts the count over.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combien de tours Sagax lance de lui-même tant que la condition n'est pas remplie, avant de t'attendre. Un message de ta part remet le compte à zéro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much loads each turn": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How much loads each turn"
