            "value": "Itálico"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its MCP servers and skills are available to every bot. A server that runs a command starts off: test it, then turn it on. Skills start off until you read them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Its MCP servers and skills are available to every bot. A server that runs a command starts off: test it, then turn it on. Skills start off until you read them."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ses serveurs MCP et ses compétences sont offerts à tous les bots. Un serveur qui lance une commande commence désactivé : testez-le, puis activez-le. Les compétences restent désactivées tant que vous ne les avez pas lues."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seus servidores MCP e habilidades ficam disponíveis para todos os bots. Um servidor que executa um comando começa desativado: teste e depois ative. As habilidades ficam desativadas até você lê-las."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its conversations are kept. Archived bots in the account menu brings it back.": {
      "localizations": {
