    "Keep the saved version": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garder la version enregistrée"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manter a versão salva"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep this file as a copy or backup of these bots. Copying bots into an organization is only done from the local Sagax of a Sagax desktop app, in Settings > Organization > Join and copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gardez ce fichier comme copie ou sauvegarde de ces bots. La copie de bots dans une organisation se fait seulement depuis le Sagax local d'une app de bureau Sagax, dans Réglages > Organisation > Rejoindre et copier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep your connected apps unavailable to this bot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep your connected apps unavailable to this bot."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garder vos apps connectées hors de portée de ce bot."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manter seus apps conectados indisponíveis para este bot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps these notes in shape without the bot having to remember to: notices facts you mention in chats and files them (core facts here, detail in topic files it creates) and tidies up every night: expired notes are archived, duplicates merged, contradicted notes crossed out. Facts about you are added to About me (Settings → General), where every bot reads them and you can remove any. Every change shows below and can be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps these notes in shape without the bot having to remember to: notices facts you mention in chats and files them (core facts here, detail in topic files it creates) and tidies up every night: expired notes are archived, duplicates merged, contradicted notes crossed out. Facts about you are added to About me (Settings → General), where every bot reads them and you can remove any. Every change shows below and can be undone."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garde ces notes en ordre sans que le bot ait à y penser : il remarque les faits que vous mentionnez dans les discussions et les classe (l'essentiel ici, le détail dans des fichiers de sujets qu'il crée), et range chaque nuit : les notes expirées sont archivées, les doublons fusionnés, les notes contredites barrées. Les faits à votre sujet vont dans À propos de moi (Réglages → Général), où chaque bot les lit et où vous pouvez les retirer. Chaque changement s'affiche ci-dessous et peut être annulé."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantém estas notas em ordem sem o bot precisar lembrar: percebe fatos que você menciona nas conversas e os arquiva (o essencial aqui, os detalhes em arquivos de tópicos que ele cria) e arruma tudo toda noite: notas expiradas são arquivadas, duplicatas mescladas, notas contraditas riscadas. Fatos sobre você vão para Sobre mim (Ajustes → Geral), onde todo bot os lê e você pode removê-los. Toda alteração aparece abaixo e pode ser desfeita."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept inside Sagax for this person; can refresh itself, no public link.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kept inside Sagax for this person; can refresh itself, no public link."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gardé dans Sagax pour cette personne; peut se rafraîchir seul, sans lien public."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantido no Sagax para esta pessoa; pode se atualizar sozinho, sem link público."
          }
        }
      }
    },
