    "Lets Sagax read and send messages on the Mac where this app runs. Not from a server, and not through another Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permet à Sagax de lire et d'envoyer des messages sur le Mac où cette app tourne. Pas depuis un serveur, et pas via un autre Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets bot owners choose Full access: their bots run commands and edit files without asking. Nothing runs on the Sagax server itself. When off, Full access is unavailable and turns asking for it are refused.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lets bot owners choose Full access: their bots run commands and edit files without asking. Nothing runs on the Sagax server itself. When off, Full access is unavailable and turns asking for it are refused."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permet aux propriétaires de bots de choisir l'accès complet : leurs bots exécutent des commandes et modifient des fichiers sans demander. Rien ne s'exécute sur le serveur Sagax lui-même. Désactivé, l'accès complet n'est plus offert et les tours qui le demandent sont refusés."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permite que os donos de bots escolham Acesso total: os bots rodam comandos e editam arquivos sem perguntar. Nada roda no próprio servidor Sagax. Desativado, o Acesso total fica indisponível e os turnos que o pedem são recusados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets this bot send spoken notes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permet à ce bot d'envoyer des notes parlées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets your bots catch up on conversations, find an older message, or look at a photo someone sent. Needs Full Disk Access so Sagax can read chat.db on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lets your bots catch up on conversations, find an older message, or look at a photo someone sent. Needs Full Disk Access so Sagax can read chat.db on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permet à vos bots de rattraper des conversations, de retrouver un ancien message ou de regarder une photo reçue. Demande l'accès complet au disque pour que Sagax lise chat.db sur ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets your bots reply or text someone when asked. Each send follows your approval level and the bot's allowed recipients. Needs Automation for Messages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lets your bots reply or text someone when asked. Each send follows your approval level and the bot's allowed recipients. Needs Automation for Messages."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permet à vos bots de répondre ou d'écrire à quelqu'un quand on le leur demande. Chaque envoi suit votre niveau d'approbation et les destinataires permis du bot. Demande l'automatisation de Messages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
