    "Notes every bot of this group reads at each turn here, and writes when it learns something the whole group should keep. A bot's own memory stays private and never lands here on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes every bot of this group reads at each turn here, and writes when it learns something the whole group should keep. A bot's own memory stays private and never lands here on its own."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes que chaque bot de ce groupe lit à chaque tour ici, et qu'il complète quand il apprend quelque chose que tout le groupe doit garder. La mémoire propre d'un bot reste privée et n'arrive jamais ici d'elle-même."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notas que cada bot deste grupo lê a cada turno aqui, e escreve quando aprende algo que o grupo todo deve guardar. A memória própria de um bot continua privada e nunca vem parar aqui sozinha."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notes this bot keeps between tasks. They are plain markdown files in a folder on this computer. Open them in any editor, or in Obsidian.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes this bot keeps between tasks. They are plain markdown files in a folder on this computer. Open them in any editor, or in Obsidian."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les notes que ce bot garde d'une tâche à l'autre. Ce sont de simples fichiers markdown dans un dossier de cet ordinateur. Ouvrez-les dans n'importe quel éditeur, ou dans Obsidian."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notas que este bot guarda entre tarefas. São arquivos markdown simples em uma pasta deste computador. Abra-os em qualquer editor ou no Obsidian."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notes this bot keeps between tasks. They are plain markdown files in a folder on your computer. Open them in any editor, or in Obsidian.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes this bot keeps between tasks. They are plain markdown files in a folder on your computer. Open them in any editor, or in Obsidian."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les notes que ce bot garde entre ses tâches. Ce sont de simples fichiers markdown dans un dossier de votre ordinateur : ouvrez-les dans n'importe quel éditeur, ou dans Obsidian."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notas que este bot guarda entre tarefas. São arquivos markdown simples numa pasta do seu computador: abra-os em qualquer editor ou no Obsidian."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notes waiting for your review.": {
