    "Off by default. Enable it to let supported bots use a browser tab you can watch and take over.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default. Enable it to let supported bots use a browser tab you can watch and take over."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé par défaut. Activez-le pour que les bots compatibles utilisent un onglet que vous pouvez suivre et reprendre."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desativado por padrão. Ative para que os bots compatíveis usem uma aba que você pode acompanhar e assumir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. Shows Templates in the sidebar menu, to install a ready-made team of bots.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default. Shows Templates in the sidebar menu, to install a ready-made team of bots."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé par défaut. Affiche Modèles dans le menu de la barre latérale, pour installer une équipe de bots toute prête."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desligado por padrão. Mostra Modelos no menu da barra lateral, para instalar uma equipe de bots pronta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default: bots post on their own (routines, reports), so a bot you hid would come back at every run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default: bots post on their own (routines, reports), so a bot you hid would come back at every run."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé par défaut : les bots publient d'eux-mêmes (routines, rapports), un bot masqué reviendrait à chaque exécution."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desativado por padrão: bots publicam sozinhos (rotinas, relatórios), então um bot oculto voltaria a cada execução."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off gives the bots no computer and no browser.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off gives the bots no computer and no browser."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé ne donne aux bots ni ordinateur ni navigateur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off in Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé dans Réglages"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desativadas nos Ajustes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off means no screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off means no screen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé veut dire aucun écran."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desligado significa sem tela."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off on this connection: phone tools need a secure connection (HTTPS or Tailscale). On plain local Wi-Fi your answers would cross the network in clear.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off on this connection: phone tools need a secure connection (HTTPS or Tailscale). On plain local Wi-Fi your answers would cross the network in clear."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivés sur cette connexion : les outils du téléphone exigent une connexion sécurisée (HTTPS ou Tailscale). Sur le Wi-Fi local ordinaire, vos réponses traverseraient le réseau en clair."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off stops memory prompts, recall, native memory tools, upkeep, and automatic turn logs. Existing files remain available for review.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off stops memory prompts, recall, native memory tools, upkeep, and automatic turn logs. Existing files remain available for review."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé, cela arrête les invites de mémoire, le rappel, les outils de mémoire natifs, l'entretien et les journaux automatiques de tour. Les fichiers existants restent disponibles pour révision."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desligado, param os prompts de memória, a lembrança, as ferramentas nativas, a manutenção e os registros automáticos de turno. Os arquivos existentes continuam disponíveis para revisão."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off stops memory prompts, recall, native memory tools, upkeep, and automatic turn logs. Existing files remain available for review. Stop this bot's turn before changing this setting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off stops memory prompts, recall, native memory tools, upkeep, and automatic turn logs. Existing files remain available for review. Stop this bot's turn before changing this setting."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivée, la mémoire n'envoie plus de rappels, de souvenirs, d'outils de mémoire natifs, d'entretien ni de journaux de tour automatiques. Les fichiers existants restent consultables. Arrêtez le tour de ce bot avant de changer ce réglage."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desligada, a memória deixa de enviar lembretes, recordações, ferramentas de memória nativas, manutenção e registros automáticos de turno. Os arquivos existentes continuam disponíveis para revisão. Pare o turno deste bot antes de mudar este ajuste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off until you turn it on": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off until you turn it on"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé tant que vous ne l'activez pas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off until you turn it on. Your bots get read_messages and send_message only on this Mac after that.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off until you turn it on. Your bots get read_messages and send_message only on this Mac after that."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé tant que vous ne l'activez pas. Après ça, vos bots ont read_messages et send_message seulement sur ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. The bot finishes when it decides it is done.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off. The bot finishes when it decides it is done."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé. Le bot termine quand il juge avoir fini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. Update the computer yourself from its menu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivée. Mettez l'ordinateur à jour vous-même depuis son menu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. Update the computer yourself when you choose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off. Update the computer yourself when you choose."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivée. Mettez l'ordinateur à jour vous-même quand vous le voulez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: Claude bots only get the servers on this page, plus a bot project's own .mcp.json. On: they also get every MCP server and connector from your own Claude Code setup, on every message, the same way Codex bots already read your Codex config. More tools means more tokens per message, so keep this off unless you need them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off: Claude bots only get the servers on this page, plus a bot project's own .mcp.json. On: they also get every MCP server and connector from your own Claude Code setup, on every message, the same way Codex bots already read your Codex config. More tools means more tokens per message, so keep this off unless you need them."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé : les bots Claude n'ont que les serveurs de cette page, plus le .mcp.json du projet d'un bot. Activé : ils reçoivent aussi chaque serveur MCP et connecteur de votre propre configuration Claude Code, à chaque message, comme les bots Codex lisent déjà votre configuration Codex. Plus d'outils veut dire plus de jetons par message : laissez-le désactivé sauf besoin."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desativado: os bots Claude só recebem os servidores desta página, mais o .mcp.json do projeto de um bot. Ativado: eles também recebem cada servidor MCP e conector da sua configuração do Claude Code, em cada mensagem, como os bots Codex já leem sua configuração do Codex. Mais ferramentas significa mais tokens por mensagem, então deixe desativado a menos que precise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: only you see your achievements.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off: only you see your achievements."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé : vous seul voyez vos succès."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desativado: só você vê suas conquistas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: the bots neither read nor write it. The notes stay here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off: the bots neither read nor write it. The notes stay here."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
