    "On by default for your bots. Set a per-purchase or monthly limit, or an optional list of merchant sites.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On by default for your bots. Set a per-purchase or monthly limit, or an optional list of merchant sites."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allumé par défaut pour tes bots. Fixe un plafond par achat ou par mois, ou une liste optionnelle de sites marchands."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default. Save a bot's verification run as a skill from the Verify card, or ask a supported bot to run /create-verification-skill. Every change waits for your review.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On by default. Save a bot's verification run as a skill from the Verify card, or ask a supported bot to run /create-verification-skill. Every change waits for your review."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé par défaut. Enregistrez une vérification d'un bot comme compétence depuis la carte Vérifier, ou demandez à un bot compatible d'exécuter /create-verification-skill. Chaque changement attend votre révision."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ativado por padrão. Salve a verificação de um bot como habilidade pelo cartão Verificar, ou peça a um bot compatível para rodar /create-verification-skill. Cada mudança aguarda sua revisão."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On demand": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur demande"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sob demanda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On each due time, Sagax checks without any model turn and starts the run only on a change. At most one check every %lld min.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On each due time, Sagax checks without any model turn and starts the run only on a change. At most one check every %lld min."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À chaque échéance, Sagax vérifie sans aucun tour de modèle et ne lance l'exécution que s'il y a un changement. Au plus une vérification aux %lld min."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On each due time, Sagax checks without any model turn and starts the run only on a change. At most one check every %lld min."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On every check where the condition holds": {
      "localizations": {
