    "One line per bot. Bots with more than one active thread show how many; tap the number to list them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One line per bot. Bots with more than one active thread show how many; tap the number to list them."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une ligne par bot. Les bots qui ont plus d'un fil actif en indiquent le nombre; touchez le nombre pour les afficher."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma linha por bot. Bots com mais de uma thread ativa mostram quantas têm; toque no número para listá-las."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One of your rules": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One of your rules"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une de vos règles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One per person": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One per person"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un par personne"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um por pessoa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One sentence that must be true before this bot finishes, for example \"the tests pass\". After each reply in a conversation with this bot, Sagax checks it. While it is not true, Sagax relaunches the bot on its own in the same conversation, up to the number of relaunches below. Each relaunch is a normal turn and costs like one. Stop ends the relaunches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une phrase qui doit être vraie avant que ce bot termine, par exemple « les tests passent ». Après chaque réponse dans une conversation avec ce bot, Sagax la vérifie. Tant qu'elle n'est pas vraie, Sagax relance le bot de lui-même dans la même conversation, jusqu'au nombre de relances ci-dessous. Chaque relance est un tour normal et coûte comme un tour. Arrêter met fin aux relances."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One sentence that must be true before this bot finishes. While it is not, Sagax relaunches the bot on its own in the same conversation. Each relaunch is a normal turn. Stop ends the relaunches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One sentence that must be true before this bot finishes. While it is not, Sagax relaunches the bot on its own in the same conversation. Each relaunch is a normal turn. Stop ends the relaunches."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une phrase qui doit être vraie avant que ce bot termine. Tant qu'elle ne l'est pas, Sagax relance le bot de lui-même dans la même conversation. Chaque relance est un tour normal. Arrêter met fin aux relances."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One time": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
