    },
    "Optional. The clock starts when work actually begins and does not control how often the routine starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Facultatif. Le chrono démarre quand le travail commence vraiment et ne contrôle pas la fréquence de la routine."
          }
