    "Runs commands and edits files without asking. Your rules still apply: \"Ask every time\" shows a card and \"Deny\" refuses, even here. Use only with bots you trust.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs commands and edits files without asking. Your rules still apply: \"Ask every time\" shows a card and \"Deny\" refuses, even here. Use only with bots you trust."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exécute des commandes et modifie des fichiers sans demander. Vos règles s'appliquent quand même : « Demander chaque fois » montre une carte et « Refuser » refuse, même ici. À utiliser seulement avec des bots de confiance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs every": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S'exécute toutes les"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roda a cada"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs in the bot's folder, where the bot works, with the same access as the routine. At most %lld s and %lld KB of output.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs in the bot's folder, where the bot works, with the same access as the routine. At most %lld s and %lld KB of output."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S'exécute dans le dossier du bot, là où il travaille, avec les mêmes accès que la routine. Au plus %1$lld s et %2$lld Ko de sortie."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs in the bot's folder, where the bot works, with the same access as the routine. At most %1$lld s and %2$lld KB of output."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S'exécute sur"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roda em"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs on change": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs on change"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selon les changements"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs on change"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs the agent and its tools inside its Boat virtual machine. The VM wakes automatically for each run; keep Sagax running so its scheduler can launch the job.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exécute l'agent et ses outils dans sa machine virtuelle Boat. La VM se réveille automatiquement à chaque exécution; garde Sagax ouvert pour que son planificateur puisse lancer la tâche."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roda o agente e as ferramentas dele dentro da máquina virtual Boat. A VM acorda automaticamente a cada execução; mantenha o Sagax rodando para que o agendador consiga iniciar o trabalho."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs while Sagax is open on this computer: it cannot wake a sleeping Mac. A run missed by less than 12 hours still happens when the app is back; for 24/7, run Sagax on a VPS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs while Sagax is open on this computer: it cannot wake a sleeping Mac. A run missed by less than 12 hours still happens when the app is back; for 24/7, run Sagax on a VPS."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S’exécute tant que Sagax est ouvert sur cet ordinateur : il ne peut pas réveiller un Mac en veille. Une exécution manquée depuis moins de 12 heures a quand même lieu au retour de l’app; pour du 24/7, faites tourner Sagax sur un VPS."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roda enquanto o Sagax estiver aberto neste computador: ele não consegue acordar um Mac em repouso. Uma execução perdida há menos de 12 horas ainda acontece quando o app volta; para 24/7, rode o Sagax em um VPS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
