    "Shop Pay and Link are wallets you already have. Sagax asks that wallet for a one-time card only after you allow the purchase, through the wallet's own command line tool signed in on this computer. The site does not receive a saved card number, and the bot never sees it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shop Pay et Link sont des portefeuilles que tu as déjà. Sagax demande une carte à usage unique seulement après ton accord, par l'outil en ligne de commande du portefeuille connecté sur cet ordinateur. Le site ne reçoit pas le numéro enregistré, et le bot ne le voit pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shop Pay and Link are wallets you already have. Sagax asks that wallet for a one-time card only after you allow the purchase, through the wallet's own command line tool signed in on your computer. The site does not receive a saved card number, and the bot never sees it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shop Pay and Link are wallets you already have. Sagax asks that wallet for a one-time card only after you allow the purchase, through the wallet's own command line tool signed in on your computer. The site does not receive a saved card number, and the bot never sees it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shop Pay et Link sont des portefeuilles que vous avez déjà. Sagax demande une carte à usage unique seulement après votre accord, par l'outil en ligne de commande du portefeuille connecté sur votre ordinateur. Le site ne reçoit pas le numéro enregistré, et le bot ne le voit pas."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shop Pay e Link são carteiras que você já tem. O Sagax pede um cartão de uso único só depois que você aprova a compra, pela ferramenta de linha de comando da carteira conectada no seu computador. O site não recebe o número salvo, e o bot nunca o vê."
          }
        }
      }
    },
