            "value": "Le bot ne voit jamais le numéro ni le code de sécurité de la carte. Rien n'est débité avant que vous le permettiez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bot owner's computer, which serves this bot's model, is offline. Try again once it is back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bot owner's computer, which serves this bot's model, is offline. Try again once it is back."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'ordinateur du propriétaire du bot, qui sert son modèle, est hors ligne. Réessayez quand il sera de retour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bot picks where each task runs: the cloud, a Local VM, this computer or the browser, among the places available to it and allowed. Off gives it no computer and no browser.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bot picks where each task runs: the cloud, a Local VM, this computer or the browser, among the places available to it and allowed. Off gives it no computer and no browser."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bot choisit où chaque tâche s'exécute : le cloud, une VM locale, cet ordinateur ou le navigateur, parmi les endroits disponibles et autorisés. Désactivé ne lui donne ni ordinateur ni navigateur."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O bot escolhe onde cada tarefa é executada: a nuvem, uma VM local, este computador ou o navegador, entre os lugares disponíveis e permitidos. Desativado não lhe dá nenhum computador nem navegador."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bot proposes this page. It is not online: check it, choose who can see it, then publish it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bot proposes this page. It is not online: check it, choose who can see it, then publish it."
