        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le niveau d'approbation du bot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bot's computer is not running, so only this server's files were measured. Start it to measure its caches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'ordinateur du bot n'est pas démarré : seuls les fichiers de ce serveur ont été mesurés. Démarrez-le pour mesurer ses caches."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bot's computer. Switch between its desktop and its own browser here; Browser is where it reads the web and fills in forms for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'ordinateur du bot. Basculez ici entre son bureau et son propre navigateur ; Navigateur, c'est là qu'il lit le web et remplit des formulaires pour vous."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bot's main thread": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bot's main thread"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fil principal du bot"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A conversa principal do bot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bot's owner is not an active member": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bot's owner is not an active member"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le propriétaire du bot n'est pas un membre actif"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bot, its threads and its routines are removed from your computer. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bot, its threads and its routines are removed from your computer. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bot, ses fils et ses routines sont retirés de votre ordinateur. Cette action est irréversible."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O bot, suas threads e suas rotinas são removidos do seu computador. Isso não pode ser desfeito."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bots are back as they were.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les Bots sont revenus comme avant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The browser engine is not installed on this server yet. Enable the browser switches in App Settings → Developer → Experimental features and the bot's Access settings, then open Bot's computer → Browser to install it. Or run `sagax browser install` on the server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The browser engine is not installed on this server yet. Enable the browser switches in App Settings → Developer → Experimental features and the bot's Access settings, then open Bot's computer → Browser to install it. Or run `sagax browser install` on the server."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le moteur du navigateur n'est pas encore installé sur ce serveur. Activez les interrupteurs du navigateur dans Réglages → Développeur → Fonctionnalités expérimentales et dans les réglages d'accès du bot, puis ouvrez Ordinateur du bot → Navigateur pour l'installer. Ou lancez `sagax browser install` sur le serveur."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O mecanismo do navegador ainda não está instalado neste servidor. Ative as chaves do navegador em Ajustes → Desenvolvedor → Recursos experimentais e nos ajustes de acesso do bot, depois abra Computador do bot → Navegador para instalá-lo. Ou rode `sagax browser install` no servidor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The browser preview could not connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The browser preview could not connect."
          }
