          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O navegador integrado está desativado em Configurações → Desenvolvedor → Recursos experimentais"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The call always opens by saying it is an AI assistant calling on your behalf. %@ then talks with the person to reach the objective and hangs up at the time limit at the latest. Nothing is placed until you confirm the number and choose Call.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The call always opens by saying it is an AI assistant calling on your behalf. %@ then talks with the person to reach the objective and hangs up at the time limit at the latest. Nothing is placed until you confirm the number and choose Call."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'appel commence toujours en précisant qu'un assistant IA appelle en votre nom. %@ discute ensuite avec la personne pour atteindre l'objectif et raccroche au plus tard à la durée maximale. Rien n'est lancé tant que vous n'avez pas confirmé le numéro et choisi Appeler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The call failed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The call failed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'appel a échoué."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The call first says it is an AI assistant calling on your behalf, gives the callback number and how to stop the calls, says the message twice, then hangs up. Nothing is placed until you confirm the number and choose Call.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The call first says it is an AI assistant calling on your behalf, gives the callback number and how to stop the calls, says the message twice, then hangs up. Nothing is placed until you confirm the number and choose Call."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'appel dit d'abord que c'est un assistant IA qui appelle en votre nom, donne le numéro de rappel et comment ne plus recevoir d'appels, dit le message deux fois, puis raccroche. Rien n'est composé avant que vous confirmiez le numéro et choisissiez Appeler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The call was interrupted. Tap Resume the call to continue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'appel a été interrompu. Touchez Reprendre l'appel pour continuer."
          }
        }
      }
