            "value": "Le modèle local ne répond pas : son serveur est arrêté sur cet ordinateur. Démarrez-le, puis réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The longest cadence is one day. This one starts at one day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cadence la plus longue est un jour. Celle-ci part à un jour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The marketplace. Sign in to an app once and every bot can use it as a tool. We'll close this and move on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le marché d'applications. Connectez-vous une fois à une application et tous les bots peuvent l'utiliser comme outil. Nous allons fermer ceci et continuer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The memory changed again after you looked, so it can't use your Mac yet. Check the notes below, then mark them reviewed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The memory changed again after you looked, so it can't use your Mac yet. Check the notes below, then mark them reviewed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La mémoire a encore changé depuis votre lecture : elle ne peut pas encore utiliser votre Mac. Vérifiez les notes ci-dessous, puis marquez-les comme revues."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A memória mudou de novo depois que você olhou, então ainda não pode usar seu Mac. Confira as notas abaixo e marque-as como revisadas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model is overloaded right now. Try again in a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
