    "There is zero tolerance for objectionable or abusive content. Anyone can report a message or block a person, and the admins review every report.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is zero tolerance for objectionable or abusive content. Anyone can report a message or block a person, and the admins review every report."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il y a une tolérance zéro pour le contenu répréhensible ou abusif. Chacun peut signaler un message ou bloquer une personne, et les administrateurs examinent chaque signalement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are changed by an administrator, or in Sagax on your computer.": {
