            "value": "O computador deste bot está desligado"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This bot's computer is only captured while it is working.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'ordinateur de ce bot n'est capté que pendant qu'il travaille."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O computador deste bot só é capturado enquanto ele está trabalhando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This bot's conversation is working. Stop its turn to change the model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La conversation de ce bot travaille. Arrête son tour pour changer le modèle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This bot's current model cannot use the built-in browser.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This bot's current model cannot use the built-in browser."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle actuel de ce bot ne peut pas utiliser le navigateur intégré."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O modelo atual deste bot não pode usar o navegador integrado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This bot's engine can't make the quick background model call upkeep uses, so it only archives expired notes and merges exact duplicates. Claude and chat-model engines can do the rest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This bot's engine can't make the quick background model call upkeep uses, so it only archives expired notes and merges exact duplicates. Claude and chat-model engines can do the rest."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le moteur de ce bot ne peut pas faire l'appel de modèle rapide en arrière-plan qu'utilise l'entretien : il archive seulement les notes expirées et fusionne les doublons exacts. Claude et les moteurs de modèles de chat font le reste."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O motor deste bot não consegue fazer a chamada rápida de modelo em segundo plano que a manutenção usa, então só arquiva notas expiradas e mescla duplicatas exatas. Claude e motores de modelos de chat fazem o resto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This bot's engine does not load Claude Code plugins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This bot's engine does not load Claude Code plugins."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le moteur de ce bot ne charge pas les plugins Claude Code."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O mecanismo deste bot não carrega plugins do Claude Code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
