            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este é um computador pessoal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is permanent: only deleting the thread ends it. Nothing in it will be remembered, exported or shared beyond you. To work normally, open a new thread.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is permanent: only deleting the thread ends it. Nothing in it will be remembered, exported or shared beyond you. To work normally, open a new thread."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C'est permanent : seule la suppression du fil y met fin. Rien de ce fil ne sera mémorisé, exporté ni partagé au-delà de toi. Pour travailler normalement, ouvre un nouveau fil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the primary contact for %@. It can create and coordinate specialists in this team, then combine their work into one answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the primary contact for %@. It can create and coordinate specialists in this team, then combine their work into one answer."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C'est le contact principal pour %@. Il peut créer et coordonner des spécialistes dans cette équipe, puis réunir leur travail en une seule réponse."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este é o contato principal de %@. Ele pode criar e coordenar especialistas nesta equipe e depois juntar o trabalho deles em uma resposta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is where you talk to your bots. Type anything and press %@. Every chat is a real agent on your machine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C'est ici que vous parlez à vos bots. Écrivez ce que vous voulez et appuyez sur %@. Chaque conversation est un vrai agent sur votre machine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is your Primary Bot: it can act on your other bots for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is your Primary Bot: it can act on your other bots for you."
