          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este provedor não informa um preço. Os tokens são contados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This provider runs on an API key saved on the computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This provider runs on an API key saved on the computer."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce fournisseur fonctionne avec une clé API enregistrée sur l'ordinateur."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este provedor usa uma chave de API salva no computador."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the connection from this device only. It does not revoke this device on your Mac. To remove Mac-side access, open Sagax, then Settings, then Phone and remove it there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ça retire la connexion de cet appareil seulement. L'accès de cet appareil n'est pas révoqué sur ton Mac. Pour retirer l'accès côté Mac, ouvre Sagax, puis Réglages, puis Téléphone, et retire-le là."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isto remove a conexão apenas deste dispositivo. Não revoga este dispositivo no seu Mac. Para remover o acesso do lado do Mac, abra Sagax → Ajustes → Telefone e remova por lá."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the saved connection from this device only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ça retire la connexion enregistrée de cet appareil seulement."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isto remove a conexão salva apenas deste dispositivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This replaces everything in this installation; it does not merge. A recoverable safety backup of the current installation is kept before replacement. Restart is required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remplace tout le contenu de cette installation, sans fusion. Une sauvegarde de sécurité est gardée avant. Un redémarrage est nécessaire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This request cannot be sealed for your computer. Ask again from the New card form.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This request cannot be sealed for your computer. Ask again from the New card form."
