            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When it changes and the condition holds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, this bot does not write email draft cards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand c'est éteint, ce bot n'écrit pas de carte de brouillon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, this bot is not steered or stopped for a repeating shell failure.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand c'est éteint, ce bot n'est ni orienté ni arrêté pour un échec de shell qui se répète."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, a daily sweep deletes the event-log files of threads that closed or were archived more than this many days ago. It only removes event-log files, never threads or transcripts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, a daily sweep deletes the event-log files of threads that closed or were archived more than this many days ago. It only removes event-log files, never threads or transcripts."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une fois activé, un passage quotidien supprime les fichiers de journal des fils fermés ou archivés depuis plus de ce nombre de jours. Seuls ces fichiers sont supprimés, jamais les fils ni les transcriptions."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando ativado, uma varredura diária exclui os arquivos de registro das conversas encerradas ou arquivadas há mais desse número de dias. Só os arquivos de registro são removidos, nunca as conversas ou transcrições."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When one of these is on, approving that kind of action asks for one of your keys. Turning one off asks for your key too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand l'une d'elles est activée, approuver ce genre d'action demande une de vos clés. La désactiver demande aussi votre clé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the app is not in front, your phone shows the unlock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the app is not in front, your phone shows the unlock."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand l'app n'est pas au premier plan, votre téléphone affiche le succès."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando o app não está em primeiro plano, seu telefone mostra a conquista."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the bot wants to:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the bot wants to:"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand le bot veut :"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this bot has a question or an approval for you, it reaches you here. Answer from there and it continues.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When this bot has a question or an approval for you, it reaches you here. Answer from there and it continues."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand ce bot a une question ou une approbation pour vous, il vous joint ici. Répondez de là et il reprend."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando este bot tem uma pergunta ou aprovação para você, ele fala com você aqui. Responda de lá e ele continua."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this bot is asked to create a page or an artifact and more than one surface is available, which one to use. Ask each time shows a choice card.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When this bot is asked to create a page or an artifact and more than one surface is available, which one to use. Ask each time shows a choice card."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand on demande à ce bot de créer une page ou un artefact et que plusieurs surfaces sont disponibles, laquelle utiliser. Demander à chaque fois affiche une carte de choix."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando este bot é pedido para criar uma página ou um artefato e mais de uma superfície está disponível, qual usar. Perguntar toda vez mostra um cartão de escolha."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this many runs fail in a row, the routine pauses itself and tells you. Resume turns it back on and starts the count again. Failed runs stay in the history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When this many runs fail in a row, the routine pauses itself and tells you. Resume turns it back on and starts the count again. Failed runs stay in the history."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand autant d'exécutions échouent de suite, la routine se met en pause et vous le dit. Relancer la réactive et remet le compte à zéro. Les exécutions échouées restent dans l'historique."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you always allow a command from an approval, it shows up here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you always allow a command from an approval, it shows up here."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand vous autorisez toujours une commande depuis une approbation, elle apparaît ici."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando você sempre permite um comando a partir de uma aprovação, ele aparece aqui."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When your computer has no voice for a bot, calls speak with ElevenLabs straight from this phone. The key stays in this phone's Keychain. Get one at elevenlabs.io, then Developers, then API keys.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand ton ordinateur n'a pas de voix pour un bot, les appels parlent avec ElevenLabs directement depuis ce téléphone. La clé reste dans le trousseau de ce téléphone. Obtiens-en une sur elevenlabs.io, puis Developers, puis API keys."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Où"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where each of your jobs spent its time and its money, from the usage ledger. Counters, time and cost only; no message content.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Où chacun de vos jobs a passé son temps et son argent, depuis le registre d’utilisation. Seulement des compteurs, du temps et un coût; aucun contenu de message."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where every bot in this group runs its shell and file tools.": {
