            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quels bots peuvent payer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which model each bot uses.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quel modèle chaque bot utilise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you are away (computer idle or locked), this routine skips its runs and tells you how many when you are back. A one-time routine waits for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While you are away (computer idle or locked), this routine skips its runs and tells you how many when you are back. A one-time routine waits for you."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pendant votre absence (ordinateur inactif ou verrouillé), cette routine saute ses exécutions et vous dit combien à votre retour. Une routine ponctuelle vous attend."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enquanto você estiver ausente (computador inativo ou bloqueado), esta rotina pula as execuções e diz quantas quando você voltar. Uma rotina única espera por você."
          }
        }
      }
    },
