            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu computador"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your computer asks to scan a payment card. The number, the expiry and the name go to its New card form; the security code is never read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your computer asks to scan a payment card. The number, the expiry and the name go to its New card form; the security code is never read."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre ordinateur demande de scanner une carte de paiement. Le numéro, l'expiration et le nom vont dans son formulaire Nouvelle carte ; le code de sécurité n'est jamais lu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your computer could not open its credential store, so it cannot say which accounts are connected. Nothing has been disconnected. Restarting Sagax on your computer usually clears this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton ordinateur n'a pas pu ouvrir son magasin d'identifiants, donc il ne peut pas dire quels comptes sont connectés. Rien n'a été déconnecté. Redémarrer Sagax sur ton ordinateur règle généralement le problème."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O seu computador não conseguiu abrir o cofre de credenciais, então não sabe dizer quais contas estão conectadas. Nada foi desconectado. Reiniciar o Sagax no seu computador costuma resolver."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your computer is waking. If it does not come back on its own, recover it. Files stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your computer is waking. If it does not come back on its own, recover it. Files stay."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre ordinateur se réveille. S'il ne revient pas de lui-même, récupérez-le. Les fichiers restent."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu computador está acordando. Se ele não voltar sozinho, recupere-o. Os arquivos ficam."
          }
        }
      }
    },
