            "value": "Le serveur Perspicax de votre organisation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your organization's capabilities are set by its admins in Perspicax. Those your bots can use are listed under Me.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les capacités de votre organisation sont réglées par ses admins dans Perspicax. Celles que vos bots peuvent utiliser sont listées sous Moi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your organization's server, and what it decides for your bots.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur de ton organisation, et ce qu'elle décide pour tes bots."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your organization's server, and what it decides for your bots."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own accounts and MCP servers. Only your conversations and your routines use them; nobody else's turn ever gets them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your own accounts and MCP servers. Only your conversations and your routines use them; nobody else's turn ever gets them."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos propres comptes et serveurs MCP. Seules vos conversations et vos routines les utilisent; aucun tour d'une autre personne ne les reçoit."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suas próprias contas e servidores MCP. Só as suas conversas e rotinas os usam; o turno de nenhuma outra pessoa os recebe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own bots may ask this iPhone for these. Each request shows a card here first; nothing runs in the background, and only over a secure connection (HTTPS or Tailscale).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your own bots may ask this iPhone for these. Each request shows a card here first; nothing runs in the background, and only over a secure connection (HTTPS or Tailscale)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos propres bots peuvent demander ces outils à cet iPhone. Chaque demande affiche d'abord une carte ici ; rien ne s'exécute en arrière-plan, et seulement sur une connexion sécurisée (HTTPS ou Tailscale)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own bots may ask this iPhone for these. You approve each request here, with Sagax open; nothing runs in the background.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your own bots may ask this iPhone for these. You approve each request here, with Sagax open; nothing runs in the background."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos propres bots peuvent demander ces outils à cet iPhone. Vous approuvez chaque demande ici, avec Sagax ouvert ; rien ne s'exécute en arrière-plan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your phone number": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your phone number"
          }
        },
